WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.934 --> 00:00:16.432
"Somebody stole Mr. Wig's money," thought Roxy.

2
00:00:16.433 --> 00:00:19.489
"I need to get to his house right away!"

3
00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:22.354
Roxy's friends were coming back toward her.

4
00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:24.744
They didn't look happy.

5
00:00:24.745 --> 00:00:29.071
"That guy didn't want any candy bars either," said Jack.

6
00:00:29.072 --> 00:00:32.165
"You know what?" said Roxy.

7
00:00:32.166 --> 00:00:35.127
"I think we skipped some houses.

8
00:00:35.128 --> 00:00:38.032
I'll go back to them."

9
00:00:38.033 --> 00:00:40.181
Roxy ran off.

10
00:00:40.182 --> 00:00:42.431
Terrell scratched his head.

11
00:00:42.432 --> 00:00:45.178
"We didn't skip any houses."

12
00:00:45.179 --> 00:00:47.226
Mara pointed to the sky.

13
00:00:47.227 --> 00:00:53.395
"Look! It's Rocket Girl!"

14
00:00:53.396 --> 00:00:56.804
A moment later Roxy arrived at Mr. Wig's house.

15
00:00:56.805 --> 00:01:01.343
Detective Smith was climbing into the safe.

16
00:01:01.344 --> 00:01:09.400
Roxy smiled. "I doubt the robber is still in there, Detective."

17
00:01:09.401 --> 00:01:14.367
"Very funny." Detective Smith pretended to laugh.

18
00:01:14.368 --> 00:01:16.351
"I know the robber isn't in here.

19
00:01:16.352 --> 00:01:18.385
I'm looking for clues."

20
00:01:18.386 --> 00:01:20.918
Mr. Wig frowned at Roxy.

21
00:01:20.919 --> 00:01:24.286
"I can't believe you're making jokes!

22
00:01:24.287 --> 00:01:27.314
My money was stolen!"

23
00:01:27.315 --> 00:01:31.066
"Don't worry, Mr. Wig," said Detective Smith.

24
00:01:31.067 --> 00:01:33.136
He stood back up.

25
00:01:33.137 --> 00:01:36.130
"We'll find the thief and get your money back.

26
00:01:36.131 --> 00:01:39.272
Rocket Girl has lots of super powers."

27
00:01:39.273 --> 00:01:44.682
"Yes, I know about Rocket Girl's super powers," said Mr. Wig.

28
00:01:44.683 --> 00:01:46.218
He looked at Roxy.

29
00:01:46.219 --> 00:01:48.251
"You can fly, right?"

30
00:01:48.252 --> 00:01:50.133
"Yep!" said Roxy.

31
00:01:50.134 --> 00:01:53.543
"Well, so can I," said Mr. Wig.

32
00:01:53.544 --> 00:01:58.140
"Because I have my very own jet."

33
00:01:58.141 --> 00:02:00.823
"Big deal," said Roxy.

34
00:02:00.824 --> 00:02:04.087
"I can shoot lasers from my eyes.

35
00:02:04.088 --> 00:02:06.866
And I can see through walls."

36
00:02:06.867 --> 00:02:09.913
"Hmph!" Mr. Wig folded his arms.

37
00:02:09.914 --> 00:02:13.377
"I'm one of the richest people in Metro City."

38
00:02:13.378 --> 00:02:15.564
Roxy folded her arms.

39
00:02:15.565 --> 00:02:18.466
"I can lift a truck."

40
00:02:18.467 --> 00:02:24.668
Mr. Wig shrugged. "Just find my money, please."

41
00:02:24.669 --> 00:02:27.960
Roxy and Detective Smith went outside.

42
00:02:27.961 --> 00:02:31.866
"I do not like that man," said Roxy.

43
00:02:31.867 --> 00:02:36.079
"Let's just try to solve this case," said Detective Smith.

44
00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:39.146
"Mr. Wig said he heard a buzzing sound.

45
00:02:39.147 --> 00:02:42.195
And there were spider webs in his bedroom."

46
00:02:42.196 --> 00:02:44.141
Roxy looked thoughtful.

47
00:02:44.142 --> 00:02:48.153
"Maybe bugs robbed Mr. Wig."

48
00:02:48.154 --> 00:02:52.307
"Ha-ha," said Detective Smith, pretending to laugh again.

49
00:02:52.308 --> 00:02:56.183
"No, I'm serious," said Roxy.

50
00:02:56.184 --> 00:02:58.964
"Remember the villain Von Buzz?

51
00:02:58.965 --> 00:03:02.288
He trained bugs to steal things."

52
00:03:02.289 --> 00:03:04.622
Detective Smith shook his head.

53
00:03:04.623 --> 00:03:08.168
"It can't be Von Buzz. He's in jail."

54
00:03:08.169 --> 00:03:11.624
"He was in jail," said Roxy.

55
00:03:11.625 --> 00:03:14.916
"But he got out two weeks ago."

56
00:03:14.917 --> 00:03:18.106
"You're right!" said Detective Smith.

57
00:03:18.107 --> 00:03:20.139
"I forgot about that."

58
00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:24.755
"Maybe Von Buzz started robbing people again," said Roxy.

59
00:03:24.756 --> 00:03:29.491
Just then Detective Smith's phone rang.

60
00:03:29.492 --> 00:03:31.986
"Yes?" said the detective.

61
00:03:31.987 --> 00:03:34.921
"Really? We'll be right there!"

62
00:03:34.922 --> 00:03:36.641
He hung up the phone.

63
00:03:36.642 --> 00:03:40.126
"Someone just broke into Mrs. Bun's house.

64
00:03:40.127 --> 00:03:42.466
She lives on this street too"

65
00:03:42.467 --> 00:03:44.488
He turned back to Roxy.

66
00:03:44.489 --> 00:03:52.091
"Let's . . . Rocket Girl?"
